{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01401",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.19,
      "end_seconds": 4.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Sorry I'm a little late, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.79,
      "end_seconds": 14.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 18.66,
      "end_seconds": 24.09,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. I hope it's alright if I stay in for this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.63,
      "end_seconds": 28.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Yes, that's no problem at all. Please sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.79,
      "end_seconds": 32.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "I'm here because of a painful widespread rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.77,
      "end_seconds": 36.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.46,
      "end_seconds": 42.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "Telmisartan. I take it 40 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 44.05,
      "end_seconds": 51.46,
      "duration_seconds": 7.41,
      "text": "It's meant to be once a day, though I don't see she take it every time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.4,
      "end_seconds": 60.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.8,
      "end_seconds": 64.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Ever since... since this morning, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.03,
      "end_seconds": 69.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "Yes, carry on. How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.08,
      "end_seconds": 73.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Pretty mild, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.99,
      "end_seconds": 79.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "Is it there all the time or does it come and go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.86,
      "end_seconds": 89.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "I'd say once or twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.94,
      "end_seconds": 94.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "So, have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.97,
      "end_seconds": 106.6,
      "duration_seconds": 10.63,
      "text": "A fever goes along with it, most of the time. With fever, a five out of ten, I suppose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.72,
      "end_seconds": 111.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Have you noticed insect bite or new medicine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.29,
      "end_seconds": 118.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "I haven't had insect bite or new medicine, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.14,
      "end_seconds": 123.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.34,
      "end_seconds": 127.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.51,
      "end_seconds": 132.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "So, a few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.87,
      "end_seconds": 145.31,
      "duration_seconds": 10.44,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours. I swim twice a week. My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.33,
      "end_seconds": 149.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.71,
      "end_seconds": 156.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "I had my septum straightened in my thirties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.22,
      "end_seconds": 168.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.27,
      "end_seconds": 174.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "I have high blood pressure, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.23,
      "end_seconds": 193.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.43,
      "end_seconds": 196.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Yes, I'm allergic to tramadol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.29,
      "end_seconds": 201.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.99,
      "end_seconds": 210.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.76,
      "end_seconds": 234.0,
      "duration_seconds": 8.24,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 125 over 79, heart rate 92, temp 39.1 degrees, oxygen saturation is 96 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.83,
      "end_seconds": 238.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.8,
      "end_seconds": 243.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "I'll explain what these mean in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.71,
      "end_seconds": 249.71,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.79,
      "end_seconds": 253.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "So, I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.88,
      "end_seconds": 268.67,
      "duration_seconds": 6.79,
      "text": "There are dusky red patches with blistering and the skin peels when I rub it lightly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.18,
      "end_seconds": 287.53,
      "duration_seconds": 14.35,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. From what you've told me and what I found, the most likely explanation is a severe drug reaction of the skin. We shouldn't forget a viral rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.06,
      "end_seconds": 324.6,
      "duration_seconds": 21.54,
      "text": "I'm going to order an urgent dermatology review, for severe drug reaction. Stop the antibiotic now and I am sending you to hospital immediately. I'd like you to see the dermatology team as well, and I'll write the referral. I'll want another look straight away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.64,
      "end_seconds": 329.34,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.3,
      "end_seconds": 333.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 335.16,
      "end_seconds": 338.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    }
  ]
}